{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "79e1ae4d34b917ba4294a41e956dcb50be16aeb2774411ba9812817c5e653813", "ja": "ブライダルフェアの思い出を語るこのみと莉\n緒。そこに、ハピマリの撮影を終えた海美と\n美奈子が戻ってくる。美奈子と海美の理想の\n新婚生活とカロリーと筋肉がぶつかり合うプ\nロポーズを聞く女子会トークを繰り広げる。", "zh": "木实和莉绪聊着有关婚纱展的回忆。\n这时，结束『幸福婚礼』拍摄工作的\n海美和美奈子回到剧场。在女孩聚会中\n开始美奈子与海美理想的新婚生活、\n卡路里与肌肉互相碰撞的求婚话题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1000_039kon", "source_sha256": "c2df4d94c4bd7290526ce94b98e72c49dd5c8365b205b7bf075a18a69b0dfcea", "ja": "それにしても、ビックリしたわ～。\nまさか莉緒ちゃんが、感極まって泣いちゃうなんて！", "zh": "不过话说回来，我真的吓了一跳～\n没想到莉绪居然感动得哭出来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1001_046rio", "source_sha256": "b01585c8fd2f86b9c5e4d04a75453308f292b7f5b426219bc7fd51c1b3c99dce", "ja": "んもう、このみ姉さん、まだブライダルフェアの話\n引っ張るの？　もう終わりって言ったじゃないっ。", "zh": "讨厌啦，木实姊，你怎么又把婚纱展那件事\n拿出来讲了啦～不是都说不提了吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1002_046rio", "source_sha256": "b6657e321c63e3877519b6cc49f31614c105f9b04160c00a4f689531022bf53d", "ja": "それに泣いたわけじゃなくて、\nちょっとウルっときちゃっただけだってば！", "zh": "而且我并没有哭，\n只是眼眶有点湿而已！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1003_039kon", "source_sha256": "dcc94d02aaac2b976025924ec37ce77adcc28f5d206c91c35e4e65f2e960f3bf", "ja": "ふふっ、ごめんごめん！\nあんまりかわいかったから、つい、ね♪", "zh": "呵呵，抱歉抱歉！\n因为你实在太可爱了，我忍不住就……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1004_039kon", "source_sha256": "62957f1e5d230bac752c0ef438e104035bceadc1353ca4d0746439ea1b656049", "ja": "あ、でも、風花ちゃんたちとは別日だったから、\n今度会ったときに教えてあげなくちゃ！", "zh": "啊，不过我们跟风花她们是不同天去的，\n下次见面时要告诉她们才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "81a90927237df0990c47431c168e9c93e2e78b9cd6a8cf834aa2adfa7d03a1a6", "ja": "いいってば～、もう！\n……はぁ、早く忘れてくれないかしら。", "zh": "不用说啦～真是的！\n……唉，拜托你快点忘了这件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1006_null", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "07ad880923aabdb83c2cc395b015a126341d5aa2f79d0b29eb02963618eb0b1b", "ja": "たっだいまーっ！\n『ハピマリ』の撮影、最高だったよ！", "zh": "我回来了～！\n『幸福婚礼』的拍摄工作真是棒极了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1008_039kon", "source_sha256": "94bc1f9d60efdd15a49e61f0541ccb3480a7a48581b8d415fcaa224975b80147", "ja": "あら、おかえりなさい、海美ちゃん、美奈子ちゃん。\n予定より早く終わったのね、{$P$}。", "zh": "哎呀，你们回来啦，海美、美奈子。\n比预定时间早结束呢，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1009_p", "source_sha256": "e94e96815e2bd8e405a6c9539a2a158b89eddee44f66ca5ffbc595455e65d8e4", "ja": "ええ、ふたりともノリノリで、\nほとんど1発OKでしたからね。", "zh": "对啊，她们两人很起劲，\n几乎都是一次就OK了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "fb33fdbdff9bd8ff566272beedbcab9d7266213ed9c1d85ec97da3f073e8e501", "ja": "えへへ、ウェディングドレス着れたから、\n今日は女子力パワーがかなりアップした気がする！", "zh": "嘿嘿，因为穿到了婚纱，\n我觉得我今天女子力Power上升了非常多！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1011_p", "source_sha256": "84775b6c4baeab0647117178d7686376f141ef97203e245d44750f8f10d00681", "ja": "力とパワーで被ってるが……。\nまあ、仕事が楽しかったのなら何よりだよ。", "zh": "力跟Power的意思重复了啦……\n算了，工作开心比什么都重要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1012_019min", "source_sha256": "a609212c48b115d63e3cc865b8491e8e4dcfcf7bd593bd764c11e5b777a0912c", "ja": "ウェディングドレスなんて、\n私にはまだ早いって思ってたんですけど……。", "zh": "我之前觉得婚纱这种东西，\n对我来说还太早了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "1b858f7494d4bdd020462cd4ed41e4cddd1b6bdfe39aa53a113b043d8e9cdfa2", "ja": "実際に着てみると、何だかしっくりきちゃいました！\nまた着せてくださいね、{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "不过实际一穿，觉得还挺适合的！\n以后要再让我穿喔，{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "3ebffa1f0f8e213a4bed63a0a03d3aca462737c4900c76a204d76220e9aedd14", "ja": "今日は休憩中に、海美ちゃんと理想の新婚生活について\nいっぱい話しましたから。準備バッチリです♪", "zh": "今天休息的时候，我跟海美聊了好多\n关于理想新婚生活的事，做好了万全的准备♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1015_p", "source_sha256": "12ce4ba5ed3f407f7ce879fb52ebb28ce857c6164540a18b2daab81754126627", "ja": "ははは、そういう準備は\nそんなに焦らなくても……。", "zh": "哈哈哈，也不用急着做这种准备吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1016_046rio", "source_sha256": "139cca2765c13246b7d70dbacd0c475601d249b14e93c66ece85064804e6220c", "ja": "あら、面白そうじゃない！\nねえねえ、ふたりはどんな新婚生活が理想なの？", "zh": "哎呀，好像很有趣耶！\n欸欸，怎样的新婚生活对你们来说才是理想？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1017_029umi", "source_sha256": "070491ee1dce2ddec1d6571ea1da7098dd8a73b9b97a6b188326c2d46380a753", "ja": "えへへ。私はね、あのね……。\n旦那さんと一緒に、いろんなことがしてみたいんだ！", "zh": "嘿嘿，我的话嘛……\n我想跟老公一起尝试很多事情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "9b8bc06b480bf12a004dca28ffa2e9902af766a1f3e27c506d7ec1e093489296", "ja": "朝のジョギングとか筋トレとか、ストレッチとか！\nお休みの日はダンスとかボルダリングとか、水泳とか！", "zh": "像是晨跑、重训或伸展操之类的！\n放假的话就去跳舞、攀岩或游泳等等！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1019_p", "source_sha256": "5c34c7d3588b05de991ed2f7d339eaba0bbf5d1eaad81c243a995c6e72ed5cf4", "ja": "なるほど……。身体に良さそうだな！", "zh": "原来如此……感觉很健康呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1020_019min", "source_sha256": "67e6eb9a6f5bdb9362926198272cc44be30cadc06ebc82a4889074728528b77b", "ja": "私の理想も身体にいいですよ！　料理も愛情も特盛で、\nごはんも幸せもいーっぱいの家庭がいいです♪", "zh": "我的理想也很健康喔！料理跟爱情都要特大号的，\n是餐桌跟幸福满～满的家庭♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1021_029umi", "source_sha256": "257acbd93c5501385e5d3a7cc4f6bd91c85c0b3d8668563a277bb85a67ca34b6", "ja": "あっ、私も旦那さんのために料理作ってあげたいかも！\nまた修行させてもらっていい、美奈子先生？", "zh": "啊！我也有点想做菜给老公吃！\n美奈子老师，可以请你再指导我修行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1022_019min", "source_sha256": "d43625783b18c6079a774c6b2d91349a3e1662f805fbfb9ade57cd7cee438214", "ja": "もちろん！　将来の旦那さんの健康のために、\n一緒にがんばろうね、海美ちゃん！", "zh": "当然可以！为了未来老公的健康，\n我们一起加油吧，海美！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1023_029umi", "source_sha256": "64e0cc8190d16674309864e57ab4705494ba76af41b69ad105e5e732326a799a", "ja": "ありがとー！　ううううっ、{$P$}！\n私、花嫁修業も燃えてきた～！", "zh": "谢谢～！唔唔唔唔，{$P$}！\n我也燃起斗志要做新娘修行了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1024_p", "source_sha256": "7398730d4951c07310e25175cf0562b61076e5e274cdb67a93f35ad35b011ded", "ja": "そ、そうか。\nいいけど……ほどほどにな？", "zh": "这、这样啊。\n是很好啦……不过要适可而止喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1025_039kon", "source_sha256": "73b5f77b68b86091278a8643eee2d4f772aed00d70123687af03aae340f61b6c", "ja": "ふたりとも、夢いっぱいって感じね。\nもしかして、理想のプロポーズとかもあったりする？", "zh": "你们两人感觉都充满梦想呢。\n该不会还有什么理想中的求婚场景？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1026_046rio", "source_sha256": "01b00149aa8489fb7448c7c32cb327610a2e9ee19d98c2b7a247c9523546e4a2", "ja": "あ、私も聞いてみたい！\n私たちの撮影はこれからだし、参考になりそうだし～♪", "zh": "啊，我也想听听看！\n我们等等就要拍摄了，应该可以当作参考～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1027_019min", "source_sha256": "c27a8aa31ed8f49e99be40c04a83770644b6b9978dbcdcb4134e6ccebebcdcb5", "ja": "ぷ、プロポーズですか？　ううーん、そうだなぁ。\n私はまだ、これっていう理想は……。", "zh": "求、求婚吗？嗯～这个嘛，\n我还没有心目中的理想答案……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1028_029umi", "source_sha256": "38fb97614f813aea61f69a9e8414deba422f0b8a2b1b5a23b11c5c890e24f8ba", "ja": "わ、私も、まだ考えたことないかも……。\nえへへ。", "zh": "我、我好像也没有想过……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1029_019min", "source_sha256": "527332c2a82d3b74958cf5cae89faf36be990e99d7c3c695c44b7545418fa1fe", "ja": "……あっ、でも、こんな感じならいいかも♪\n海美ちゃん、ちょっとお願いね！", "zh": "……啊！不过，如果是这样的话感觉不错♪\n海美，请你帮个忙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1030_029umi", "source_sha256": "9fde5213355248f6c008e37373903ba18a24a94336ae528293943dcfebb810be", "ja": "あ、そうだね！　ふたりでやってみよう！", "zh": "啊，也对！我们两人来演一下吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1031_019min", "source_sha256": "013012980a7b9147861fd021178d37730778d20eb2583b334f6a6151770c99a3", "ja": "じゃあ想像して？\nここは夕焼けが綺麗な、海辺の砂浜……。", "zh": "那大家想像一下喔，\n这里是有着美丽夕阳的海边沙滩……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1032_019min", "source_sha256": "9fcdebc989e6d6c27b6c61b12bfc886a7f3e31f4f0539a55bb1fef1f07a4849f", "ja": "夕焼け、綺麗だね、高坂くん……。", "zh": "夕阳好美喔，高坂……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1033_029umi", "source_sha256": "541a45259708d91bbad34831282e32820d06e961e9c5c31ede31d7733a325ada", "ja": "ああ。でも、みなちんのほうがもっと綺麗さ。\nさあ、この指輪と、特大中華鍋を受け取って欲しい。", "zh": "对啊，不过，美美奈比夕阳更美。\n美美奈，希望你能收下这个戒指跟特大炒锅。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1034_019min", "source_sha256": "05ab342b59f0b344592e0fcddf8040284cc7316e40cc953c6dbc42df7f890a26", "ja": "それって……婚約指輪！？", "zh": "这是……结婚戒指！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1035_029umi", "source_sha256": "82972e18d9e25b4a1a86868fbd82d1debd9295f2eeb7eb016481f3add16744cc", "ja": "これで僕のために毎日、おいしいご飯を作ってくれ！\n僕はそのカロリーを、筋肉に変えてみせる！", "zh": "用这个每天为我做好吃的饭菜吧！\n我会将那些卡路里化为肌肉的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1036_019min", "source_sha256": "7ab7d28086dd48de55a94ae053eeac4f15e702215e2bab22fa0298d12b5789bd", "ja": "高坂くん……わかった！　それなら私は、絶対に毎日、\n高坂くんの消費カロリーを越える料理を作るね！", "zh": "高坂……我知道了！既然这样，\n我每天一定会做出超越高坂消耗卡路里的饭菜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1037_019min", "source_sha256": "526c9af1b88b462dd2e8f589dc91e6e158145a650940e57f01b79db1575a3ed6", "ja": "私、絶対に高坂くんの消費カロリーを越えてみせる！\n消費カロリー以上のご飯を毎日作ってみせるから！", "zh": "我一定会超越高坂的消耗卡路里！\n我每天都会做出超过消耗卡路里的饭菜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1038_029umi", "source_sha256": "a8df5663218a80ef0166a537938b196ef5fcda333e4b4b69522bb024c99be161", "ja": "みなちん！", "zh": "美美奈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1039_019min", "source_sha256": "78aa4d6daec89342c1fde3bdeb91781048554de5af93e6925e1d7fee7cd9733b", "ja": "高坂くん！", "zh": "高坂！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1040_019min", "source_sha256": "4af5dc9baf1ed6b2fb94efee8609a4c9c236ce8e60b21e9647524a1eb6f00c3d", "ja": "はい、とりあえずこんな感じが、\n私の理想のプロポーズかもしれません！", "zh": "好的，总之就是这样，\n这大概就是我理想中的求婚场景吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1041_029umi", "source_sha256": "f3ff04117874ba11ed32e930cfd507d398e59105cb292487dc16a8701a05d6c0", "ja": "私も、えっと……理想かわからないけど、\nいっぱいご飯は食べたいなっ☆", "zh": "我也……呃……虽然不确定是不是理想，\n但我想吃很多饭菜呢☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1042_039kon", "source_sha256": "995485d090fc333a8639a25d7c3fb41bde1c18c13c93ff42c6ae83fef8e51f12", "ja": "やりとりの内容は、よくわからなかったけど……。\nロマンチックなシチュエーションは大事よね！", "zh": "我是不太懂你们在演什么……\n不过浪漫的情境很重要呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1043_046rio", "source_sha256": "3f8c249c3a76ff9590fda04a045711589a07ad6598f8edf4bbb66500c54701d1", "ja": "ロマンチックか～。トッテモタカイツリーが見える\nレストランでプロポーズ、なんてのもいいかも♪", "zh": "浪漫啊～在可以看到高耸入云塔的餐厅求婚\n这种的好像也不错♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1044_p", "source_sha256": "8b95d0ac8c5a260ae1f25d086984c17176f98d7a22f55057bb3cad0d795d3a50", "ja": "（みんな生き生きと語っている……。やっぱり\nウェディングには、いろいろ憧れがあるんだろうな）", "zh": "（大家谈论得好热烈……\n大家果然都对结婚有很多向往吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1045_046rio", "source_sha256": "f64e3d969af9cd23f418306d3bb3866f422d72c1d607976cfe448ac1496cbc15", "ja": "あら？　なによ、{$P$}くんったら\n花嫁のお父さんみたいな顔しちゃって～♪", "zh": "哎呀？{$P$}是怎样，\n露出一副新娘父亲的表情～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1046_046rio", "source_sha256": "42367d58366157699b4fc4e0bcbefa0099a98c3481eec50fedb5970cffb2d273", "ja": "さては、海美ちゃんや美奈子ちゃんがお嫁さんにいく\n時のこと想像して、寂しくなっちゃったんでしょ！", "zh": "我知道了，你是在想像海美跟美奈子出嫁时的情景，\n然后开始觉得寂寞了对不对！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1047_p", "source_sha256": "c1da42f7a7162beb410d0cde3faa47aef36beb3aa67f1358941d5d61b92f5d76", "ja": "え？　いや、そういうわけじゃないけど……。\nだいたいふたりとも、まだ高校生だぞ？", "zh": "咦？没有，并不是这样……\n再说她们两位都还是高中生耶。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1048_019min", "source_sha256": "b6247e313c96edd7edb63225cf51df609e0df97ee8ea6c770330bcfd4d9b9410", "ja": "むぅ。もしかして{$P$}さん、\n私達のこと、子ども扱いしてませんか？", "zh": "唔，{$P$}先生，\n你是不是把我们当成小孩子看待？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1049_019min", "source_sha256": "bd4bd96910207c3b93267ebe25e67fdad087285552e50c775b446caf595ecf3c", "ja": "私達、もう結婚できる年齢なんですからね！", "zh": "我们已经是可以结婚的年龄啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1050_039kon", "source_sha256": "5b5d875c1f4edeaa7e04f9ef457ecd006dfa6f9537b2aa7151780920f7441335", "ja": "まあまあ。{$P$}が、\n親目線になっちゃうのもムリないわよ。", "zh": "好啦好啦，{$P$}\n会有做父亲的心情也是难免的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1051_039kon", "source_sha256": "5b70d72c96d186157ffe33ff0193b6afd894be0b3bd496c1f7f8e644e2fda2db", "ja": "だっていつも一番そばで、私たちを見守ってくれている\nんだもの……。もう、家族みたいなものよね。ウフフ♪", "zh": "毕竟他一直待在离我们最近的地方守护着我们……\n已经像是家人一样了，呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1052_p", "source_sha256": "c7248ac12ef9f6438359cd7ea3c17a1edbf3654ad19d02f7ce13a153490daecd", "ja": "（……このみさんがうまくまとめてくれたが、\nまだまだこの女子会トークは続きそうだ）", "zh": "（……虽然木实做了个完美的总结，\n但这个女孩聚会的聊天话题感觉还会继续下去。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_03_1053_p", "source_sha256": "6f04823b48ea8298468fe1f3618bd4d0b50fabe794e3dcc18b8c1ba9e9df607d", "ja": "（莉緒やこのみさんの撮影でも、今みたいに\n生き生きとした姿を撮ってもらわないとな！）", "zh": "（轮到莉绪跟木实拍摄时，希望她们\n也能有现在这般神采奕奕的模样！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
